    "body": "## Summary\n- keep completed-job review eligibility and persistence unchanged when either participant has blocked the other\n- suppress the direct `REVIEW_RECEIVED` notification across a symmetric user block so blocking cannot reopen a notification/contact channel\n- document the accountability/privacy boundary in `USER_BLOCKING.md`\n\n## Tests\n- add a regression unit test proving a blocked participant's eligible review is still persisted\n- verify no direct notification is emitted for the blocked relationship\n- retain the existing unblocked notification assertion\n\nCI and runtime smoke workflows should validate the branch before merge.",
